<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{% if title %}{{ title }} · {% endif %}Crystopedia</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{ description or 'Crystopedia – an encyclopedia of every known mineral, crystal and gemstone: formulas, crystal systems, hardness, density and more.' }}">
<link rel="icon" href="/assets/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<script>(function(){var t;try{t=localStorage.getItem("theme")}catch(e){}if(t!=="light"&&t!=="dark")t=matchMedia("(prefers-color-scheme: dark)").matches?"dark":"light";document.documentElement.dataset.theme=t})()</script>
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/style.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/redesign.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/crystalfy.css">
{% set pat = (m.pattern if (m and m.pattern) else pagePattern) %}{% if pat %}<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/patterns/patterns.css"><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/assets/patterns/{{ pat }}.svg">{% endif %}
<script src="/assets/fx.js" defer></script>
<script src="/assets/fx2.js" defer></script>
{% block head %}{% endblock %}
</head>
<body class="{{ bodyClass or '' }}"{% if bodyStyle %} style="{{ bodyStyle }}"{% endif %}>
{% if pat %}<div id="stone-pattern" class="pat-{{ pat }}" aria-hidden="true"></div><div id="stone-pattern2" class="pat-{{ pat }}" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="nebula" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></div>{% endif %}
<div class="starfield" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="wrap header-inner">
    <a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/assets/favicon.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30"><span>Crystopedia</span></a>
    <button class="nav-toggle" aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false" onclick="var o=document.body.classList.toggle('nav-open');this.setAttribute('aria-expanded',o?'true':'false');this.textContent=o?'✕':'☰'">☰</button>
    <nav class="nav" id="site-nav">
      <a href="/a-z/a/">A–Z</a>
      <a href="/gemstones/">Gemstones</a>
      <a href="/colors/">Colors</a>
      <a href="/intentions/">Intentions</a>
      <a href="/birthstones/">Birthstones</a>
      <a href="/healing-crystals/">Healing</a>
      <a href="/pairings/">Pairings</a>
      <a href="/fossils/">Fossils</a>
      <a href="/geodes/">Geodes</a>
      <a href="/star-stones/">Stars</a>
      <a href="/handle-with-care/">⚠ Care</a>
      <a href="/arkansas/">Arkansas</a>
      <a href="/uv-reactive/">UV Glow</a>
      <a href="/crystal-systems/">Systems</a>
      <a href="/compare/">Compare</a>
      <a href="/lookalikes/">Look-alikes</a>
      <a href="/identify/">Identify</a>
      <a href="/book/">📖 The Book</a>
      <a href="/search/" class="nav-search">🔍 Search</a>
    </nav>
    <button class="theme-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Toggle dark mode" title="Toggle dark mode"><span class="tt-icon">🌙</span></button>
  </div>
</header>
<main class="wrap">
{{ content | safe }}
</main>
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="author-foot" aria-labelledby="af-h">
      <div class="af-photos"><span class="facet-frame"><img src="/assets/author/tiffany-sunset.webp" alt="Tiffany Stark, author of Crystopedia, at sunset" width="720" height="718" loading="lazy"><i class="fc tl"></i><i class="fc tr"></i><i class="fc bl"></i><i class="fc br"></i></span><span class="facet-frame"><img src="/assets/author/tiffany-portrait-bw.webp" alt="Black-and-white portrait of Tiffany Stark" width="536" height="720" loading="lazy"><i class="fc tl"></i><i class="fc tr"></i><i class="fc bl"></i><i class="fc br"></i></span></div>
      <div class="af-body">
        <h2 id="af-h"><span class="gold-star inline" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="gstarf" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#fff6c9"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#b8860b"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#ffe08a"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon points="50,4 61,37 96,37 68,58 78,92 50,72 22,92 32,58 4,37 39,37" fill="url(#gstarf)" stroke="#fff3c4" stroke-width="2"/></svg></span> About the Author</h2>
        <h3>Tiffany Stark</h3>
        <p>A small-town girl, Arkansas born and raised, Tiffany Stark has been picking up rocks since the day she could get around on her own. Her pockets have always been full and heavy, just waiting for the next stone to fill them to capacity. Today she lives on the shores of Greers Ferry Lake, where the water meets the wild, moving between the rhythm of the lake, a garden full of giant Monsteras and fruiting passion vines, and the quiet company of her dogs.</p>
        <p>An avid collector for more than 15 years, she carries a working knowledge of thousands of stones gathered from shorelines, creek beds and rock shops. She approaches crystals the way she approaches the rest of the natural world: with curiosity, respect, and a practical eye for what actually helps. To her, every stone is a tiny piece of history to keep for herself and to share the knowledge about.</p>
        <p>When she's not writing or tending plants, you'll find her on the water, capturing golden-hour light, or simply sitting with a stone in her hand and the Arkansas sky overhead. Crystopedia is her love letter to all of them, and her hope is that these pages help you bring a little of the earth's steady energy into your own everyday moments.</p>
      <div class="af-more"><span class="facet-frame"><img src="/assets/author/tiffany-lake.webp" alt="Tiffany Stark by the lake" width="477" height="720" loading="lazy"><i class="fc tl"></i><i class="fc tr"></i><i class="fc bl"></i><i class="fc br"></i></span><span class="facet-frame"><img src="/assets/author/tiffany-paddle.webp" alt="Tiffany Stark paddling on Greers Ferry Lake" width="478" height="720" loading="lazy"><i class="fc tl"></i><i class="fc tr"></i><i class="fc bl"></i><i class="fc br"></i></span><span class="facet-frame"><img src="/assets/author/tiffany-crystal-portrait.webp" alt="Tiffany Stark with crystals" width="720" height="480" loading="lazy"><i class="fc tl"></i><i class="fc tr"></i><i class="fc bl"></i><i class="fc br"></i></span></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <p><strong>Crystopedia</strong> · Mineral data from <a href="https://www.wikidata.org/">Wikidata</a> (<a href="https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/">CC0</a>), built {{ site.stats.built }}. Photos are hot-linked from <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/">Wikimedia Commons</a>; each image links to its file page with author and license. Species list follows the <a href="https://www.ima-mineralogy.org/">IMA</a> via Wikidata. For deeper data and localities see <a href="https://www.mindat.org/">Mindat.org</a>.</p>
    <p class="muted">Data may contain errors – values were automatically sanity-checked and implausible ones removed. Metaphysical descriptions are traditional and folk beliefs, not scientific or medical claims.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
